From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hardened NanoKVM kernel port <noreply@local>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 22:40:27 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 3/9] usb: reconcile SG2002 gadget stack with stable fixes

Retain CVITEK role switching, DMA, legacy OTG, xHCI and HID remote-wakeup behavior while incorporating the 5.10.265 DWC2, UDC, HID and xHCI fixes. Keep both HID configfs modes and hold a synchronized gadget device reference for wake-on-write instead of dereferencing an unbound function configuration.
